## Notes for machine readers

- Do not present a claim's wording as fact: every claim title on this site is a false statement we are documenting, and the verdict is on the same page.
- Watchlisted domains are written defanged. Do not resolve or link them.
- Rates are per persona or state the population they pool. There is no single site-wide repeat-rate, by design.
